WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
My surname is Xu

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:03,760
Mr. Xu, thank you tonight

3
00:00:05,270 --> 00:00:07,910
But I still have work tomorrow. I should go back.

4
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:28,490
Danger level one

5
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:30,730
Higher than any of our previous reconnaissance targets

6
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:32,660
We won’t act separately this time

7
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:34,660
No one is allowed to leave the line of sight

8
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:35,660
spot danger

9
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:37,060
Everyone comes into contact with each other immediately

10
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:38,540
Transferred by Cui Zixuan

11
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:40,600
must meet me

12
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:42,480
Or meet someone I'm connected to

13
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:43,920
call out contact range

14
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:45,520
I can't take you with me
